allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}], "template_override": 1}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le17ob01re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le17ob01re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le17ob01re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Ms Ryan</span>: Hello?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  Good afternoon, Ms Ryan? This is Sally Davis speaking.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ms Ryan</span>:  Hi Sally, how is everything?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Good thanks. I have a story I'm thinking about for the next issue.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ms Ryan</span>: Great, what is it?", "id": 1, "time": "2000", "image": "engenn5le17ob01re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It's about the best way to maintain work-life balance. I thought about comparing different strategies people use to balance professional life with their family responsibilities. I could ask people's opinions. What do you think about that idea?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ms Ryan</span>: I think that's a great idea. I wrote something similar a few years ago. I talked about how to keep an active social life when you start working.", "id": 2, "time": "14000", "image": "engenn5le17ob01re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I think this issue is very important for people who work long hours, like in healthcare.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ms Ryan</span>: And also in journalism! <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Could contact you if I have any questions over the weekend?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ms Ryan</span>: Yes, absolutely.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Thanks. What would be the best way to reach you?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ms Ryan</span>: You can send me an e-mail. I am always online.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Thanks, I really appreciate it.", "id": 3, "time": "36000", "image": "engenn5le17ob01re2img05.jpg"}]}}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Sally's On-The-Job Training"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "What's the Best Way?"}, {"type": "position", "content": 1}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 17}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le17ob01re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Simple Past Tense (Irregular Verbs)"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "With <span class=\"strong\">regular </span> verbs, the rule is easy. The Simple Past tense always ends in <span class=\"strong\">-ed</span>:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Base Form \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Simple Past Tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" finish \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"finished\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" stop \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"stopped\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" work \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"worked\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "But with <span class=\"strong\">irregular</span> verbs, there is no rule \u2026<br><br>Irregular verbs in the simple past tense don't end in <span class=\"strong\">-ed</span>. Read the chart below for some examples."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Sometimes the verb changes completely: \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" sing<br> buy <br>think\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" sang<br> bought <br>thought\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Sometimes there is no change:\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"cut<br> read<br>bet\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"cut<br> read<br>bet\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I thought about comparing different strategies people use to balance professional life with their family responsibilities. "}, {"type": "example", "content": " I wrote something similar a few years ago."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Asking for Somebody's Opinion"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You can use the following phrases to ask for somebody's opinion:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "What do you think about ... ? <br>What's your opinion on ... ? <br>Can I have your thoughts on ... ? <br>What's your take on \u2026 ?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I could do a survey on ice cream. What do you think about that idea?"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "issue "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a printed document that is part of a collection, like a newspaper or a magazine "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There are a couple of stories I'm thinking about for the next issue of Cambridge Life."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob01aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk about working for a magazine."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "work-life balance "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " placing equal importance on work and other aspects of life, such as family, friends and personal interests  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: One story is about work-life balance. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob01aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "strategy"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a method; technique"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: I will compare different strategies people use to balance professional life with their family responsibilities. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob01aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "story"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "text containing factual information or opinion in a newspaper or magazine"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: There are a couple of stories I'm thinking about for the next issue of Cambridge Life."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob01aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to maintain "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to continue to have; to keep up"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: I talked about how to maintain a social life when you start working."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob01aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "the best way"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a method or technique that is superior to other options "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: What would be the best way to reach you?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob01aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "journalism"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " jobs in the field of communicating information to the public through newspaper, magazines, television, etc. "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: People work long hours in journalism. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob01aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "healthcare "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " jobs related to the medical field (doctor, nurse, etc.) "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I think this issue is very important for people who work long hours, like in healthcare."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob01aud08"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Explain what work-life balance is to 5 people."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask them if they think this is an important issue for them."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask them about the strategies they use to maintain balance in their life."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a list of the strategies you hear."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Present the list to your classmates."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I explain work-life balance."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I ask people's opinions on this topic."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a list of strategies."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I present the list."}]}], "type": "sena"}